   "rule": "When the foe is Broken or you are first Wounded, your slotted arts come ready (not sooner than cooldown_min) and your next soul art deals +30 % soul damage.",
   "approx": "Uses timer which='all' by=-999 because timer cannot filter to dtype 'soul' only; the +30 % x_soul charge still consumes only on a soul art firing."
